     "titulo": "Suggesting an appointment",
     "texto": [
      "To suggest a time, you can offer a specific **tidspunkt** and ask whether the other person is available.",
      "**Tid** can mean «time» or «hour», depending on the context. **Tidspunkt** refers to a specific moment."
